00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:14.820
because pretty much every day was so densely packed

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.080
and frantic, that it'll sound horrible.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.520
But just know that I've been happier, than I've been

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.580
in a long time

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.180
in all my time on YouTube,

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.800
and probably my entire life,

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:32.640
I've never been this busy and this excited to work

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.280
on stuff like we've been doing this past week.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.180
And let me just-let me set this scene for you. I got to back up a bit

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.840
before I can dive into that.

