As many of you know, Tyler has been helping me out here and

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.780
Tyler is a guy I've known since the fourth grade.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.380
I've known him for years.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:51.160
We know each other... too well.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.660
Like scary well, we get along that well

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.780
and it's just so good to have someone out there

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:01.220
because Tyler pushes me to be a better person.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:05.100
Tyler pushes me to explore the ideas that I wouldn't

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.400
ordinarily do. And-and I don't want to sing praises to Tyler

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.440
