00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.520
We didn't know how it was gonna turn out before we filmed it,

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.140
but AFTER we filmed it...

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:26.100
we caught this spark that just COULD NOT be stopped.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.800
NOTHING was gonna get in the way,

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:30.580
and that's part of the reason why we only did one video a day.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.940
Because we literally just

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:32.440
SPRINTED

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:33.280
forward, and we're like

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.780
"We're gonna fuckin' do this!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.660
I don't care what it takes,

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:37.500
we wanna do it!"

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.640
So the next thing we did was -

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.520
we had this idea, and we had this turkey costume,

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:41.460
that is was gonna be like:

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:42.080
"Hey!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.200
We wanted to do this,"

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:44.760
kinda like things saying,

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.520
"Hey! Give Thanksgiving it's room!

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.000
Christ- it's not Christmas yet!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.000
It's not December!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.180
Or, at least wait AFTER Thanksgiving!"

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:51.920
And then,

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:52.940
it was just-

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:53.620
oh, man!

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.040
It turned out so well!

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:55.700
And it was jus-

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:59.000
we found this rhythm with the musical intros.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:11:59.940
And it was just

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:00.740
SO

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:01.660
COOL!

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.320
GAWD!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:03.220
I loved it!

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:04.720
I loved every part of it!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:09.180
I kept gushing to absolutely everybody that would listen to me...

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.780
about how much I loved it,

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.320
and I'm still doing it!!

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.560
AHHH Gahd.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.420
Mark: "I just want everyone to know about my new inside pocket,

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.686
It's called my /BUTTHOLE/ (wait, you only got it now?)

00:12:19.146 --> 00:12:21.561
*giggles happily*

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.820
I- Why am I laughing at myself

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.580
That's the most narcissistic thing that I could possibly do

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.620
It's so...it's so good to see...

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.240
Ohhh no it's so good to see!

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:34.800
Oh it's SO GOOD to see this!

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:37.700
It's so good to experience this because-

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.800
What we went through this past week.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:43.520
Is by any definition, life changing.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:46.920
Like, literally I mean that, it's changed..

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:51.000
..my life. Because I feel like I was on the wrong path.

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.260
I really do, and i'm sorry about that.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:58.800
Because it- it's not numbers that define me.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.660
It's not numbers that define this channel

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:04.380
And it's not numbers that define the community.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.700
I'm very fortunate and I am eternally grateful.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.180
That 15 million people

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:12.260
Thought my videos were worth subscribing to.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:17.140
And i'm always going to be grateful for that, but I fear-

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.720
That I was growing complacent in those numbers.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.840
I was looking at those numbers and I was going

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.060
"That's good enough.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:29.680
I've done enough, I can rest, This is okay.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:32.860
That's not true at all.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.600
I grew, lazy.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:39.800
In my confidence, of what I had.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:45.540
That I allowed myself, to lose sight, of the final goal.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.460
And the final goal is to be

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.760
The best Youtuber that I can be.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:55.980
Maybe i'll never be the best youtuber ever.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:14:00.020
But that doesn't mean that I shouldn't keep trying.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:04.280
Every single day as hard as I can.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.860
To be better, not only for my own sake

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.780
But for you guys as well.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:12.937
Because you guys are /everything/.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.180
To this channel, you guys are absolutely everything

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:20.140
To who we as youtubers are, and

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.720
Who I define myself as a person.

00:14:24.015 --> 00:14:25.395
(Awwwwwww, shucks Mark)

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:28.540
I-I- I really mean that honestly and truely

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:32.300
like I define myself by the community that I've built.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.820
And if I let my community go deastray-

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.260
-Go astray

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.080
Then I have

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.160
Failed.

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:41.260
..So.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:44.200
Ther- There's so much other footage here

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.080
That we could go through from this past week

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.660
And this was just one week

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.380
Like in one week we've managed to create

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.940
SO many memories, have so many laughs

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:56.520
meet so many of you guys, and that was just ONE week!

00:14:57.240 --> 00:15:01.520
I can't describe how great it is, to feel that fire!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.460
BURNING in my heart again!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:08.380
And to have that PASSION back for making videos

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:13.080
And SURPRISING you every day with cool new interesting things

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.080
And I can only thank my friends

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:18.280
And my family and most of all YOU guys.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.080
For never losing hope in me.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:22.920
(And we never will)

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.840
An- I don't know what I did to deserve

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:25.720
*heh*

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.660
So many people that steadfastly believe in what I do

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:31.660
(You did what you wanted to. What you NEEDED to)

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.420
[Softly] But i'm committed.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.860
[Softly] Again, more than ever- more than ever.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.120
[Softly] Oh i'm so excited for the future.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.120
So, like I said,

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.460
We'll be back on normal schedule very soon.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.200
8 and 12 every day.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.140
8am's will be long plays

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.800
And 12am's

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.080
*BLEEGH*

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.180
..12 PM's

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.520
..NOON, also known as.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.620
Will be something special.

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.860
And I think you're gonna like it.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:02.020
So THANK you everybody so much for watching.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.260
and as always, I will see you-

